# Reown / WalletConnect Cloud project ID.
# Required to initialize the wallet-connect modal (Reown AppKit).
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://dashboard.reown.com
# 2. Copy this file to .env  ->  cp .env.example .env
# 3. Paste your project ID below.
#
# NOTE: Vite only exposes env vars prefixed with VITE_ to client code
# (import.meta.env.VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID).
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id_here
